  "title": "Vegan Wild Rice Salad",
  "description": "Sweet, tart grapes and cranberries mingle with chickpeas and scallions in a quick and easy vegan wild rice salad that&#39;s perfect for parties.",
  "authors": [
    "weelittlevegan"
  ],
